  description: '2+ "Gouki" monsters

    Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can return
    to the hand any number of "Gouki" monsters you control that this card points
    to, then target the same number of face-up cards your opponent controls; they
    have their effects negated until the end of this turn. This card can attack all
    monsters your opponent controls, once each. If your opponent controls a face-up
    monster(s), this card can only target their monster with the highest ATK for
    attacks (your choice, if tied).'
